The sequence analysis strongly supports an aspartate-semialdehyde dehydrogenase (Asd) assignment: two matching Pfam domains, ~53–56% identity to reviewed enzymes, near-complete coverage, and a conserved enzyme-sized architecture. I will now store these findings with provenance before reviewing them.

